  "Question": "In right triangles \\(ABC\\) and \\(DEF\\), \\(\\angle C=\\angle F=90^\\circ\\), \\(AB=DE\\), \\(AC=DF\\), and \\(\\angle A=35^\\circ\\). Find the measure of \\(\\angle E\\) in degrees.",
