  "Correct Answer": "55",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "\\(AB=DE\\) (hypotenuses) and \\(AC=DF\\) (legs), so \\(\\triangle ABC\\cong\\triangle DEF\\) by HL. \\(\\angle E\\) corresponds to \\(\\angle B\\), and \\(\\angle B=90^\\circ-35^\\circ=55^\\circ\\). Therefore, \\(\\angle E=55^\\circ\\).",
